{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi02_title", "source_sha256": "342dd6e36c51a07ae3ee5f6b5a1cafdd2419f12570016c9df9fc7335217c356b", "ja": "千早とおでかけ2", "zh": "和千早外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6271605e39b973b23eb3f884f41e15eea4189e92510d4ef94129acb3c6cd242f", "ja": "千早とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和千早外出一游的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "262314fe7b860cd158d6f66cf3dd30902c8f71812236f3541d762ef0fc058f70", "ja": "（千早がお土産を買いたいというので、駅に来た。\nそれにしても、素晴らしい駅舎だな……）", "zh": "（千早说想买伴手礼，所以我们来到了车站。不过话说回来，这座车站建筑真漂亮啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi02_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "3ba64a48ebc0bc4fc2ad1e62b745b8750a01f3758e050b88c2ee971adf86185c", "ja": "きんつばと柿の葉寿司は買えたので、あとは雑貨が\n欲しいです。えっと、どこに売っているかしら……。", "zh": "金锷烧和柿叶寿司都买到了，接下来还想买些杂货。那个……不知道在哪里卖呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1b8baefe769f11135c8b1d6e6fe16b2b6b78ffa075813e9cd3ff8b4283bd2c3d", "ja": "雑貨か。さっき見たところに、キーホルダーなんかが\n売っていたよな。そこに行ってみようか。", "zh": "杂货啊。刚才看到的地方好像有卖钥匙扣之类的。要不要去那里看看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi02_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "d86f4445cc5e49d41ed8a126966d2e8d56c4a1073f47044e8fd0b27addeeeb01", "ja": "いいですね。劇場のみんなが\n喜んでくれるお土産が買えそうです。", "zh": "好主意。看来能买到让剧场的大家都开心的伴手礼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi02_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "b7b01bf1006cefea8d26e077f56450bc7ff2351cba44dce0a2fe5bc4c894ffef", "ja": "買おうと思っていたものは、一通り揃いました。\n{$P$}、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "原本想买的东西都已经买齐了。{$P$}，谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi02_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "43a41d521c619e91e7899639e1379d42f0570b9f415427596603a216cdbfabf3", "ja": "それと、あの。これを……。", "zh": "还有，那个……这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi02_1012", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "收下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e7ae311b601f71b33a41471f9340136c4471f3f2bcf63dc9e845c5c8efb55cf6", "ja": "これは……金沢の金箔を使ったネクタイピン？\nいいのか？", "zh": "这是……用金泽金箔制作的领带夹？\n真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi02_1007_002chi", "source_sha256": "9ba0ac04b20ae04b979deadb80b8d1d7c2f2df43a0ad5b6206f35fd52d4fb14d", "ja": "はい。{$P$}に似合いそうだなと\n思ったら、つい買ってしまって。", "zh": "嗯。我觉得它很适合{$P$}先生，就不由得买下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi02_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "172205316469718e29b58b0c98272577a9942c7970e048af875379bd05c6987e", "ja": "あの……迷惑でしたでしょうか。", "zh": "那个……是不是给您添麻烦了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "fcb1b38b44c59514cf701f8e5b3595c195bb5fa9579ed69df07631734f562c0f", "ja": "そんな事ないよ。ありがとう、千早。\nさっそくつけてみようかな。……ん？　あれ？", "zh": "没有那回事。谢谢你，千早。\n我现在就戴上试试吧。……嗯？咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi02_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "35bc8546ed498081c500cc4d75722cf95c9bc711a825e589bea76267b465ac76", "ja": "ふふっ。{$P$}、それじゃ\n逆になってます。貸してください……。", "zh": "呵呵。{$P$}，这样就反了。请交给我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_002chi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_002chi02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8a7d7d689c8031d528e334cdc1684332f461f2f03dbd574cd1e4a34db6e4dfdb", "ja": "（千早に、素敵なお土産をもらってしまったな……。\nうん、明日からも頑張れそうだ）", "zh": "（好像收到了千早送的很棒的伴手礼……\n嗯，感觉从明天开始也能继续努力了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
